  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.7.0 Added global disable of logging in the config. Added local disable per method which does not use params parameter. Added safe string format for log methods with params parameter.\n      1.6.0 Removed useless check for free space when creating log files. Improved internal error logging.\n      1.5.0 Also zipping the last log file. This might be inconvenient during testing, but at least the logger won't leave unzipped files in production.\n      1.4.1 Disposing the AutoResetEvent when exiting the application process.\n      1.4.0 Improved disk writing and cancellation of the disk writer task.\n      1.3.0 Added support for AssemblyName in LoggerConfig.xml.\n      1.2.0 Added a stream flush after writing log entries to the stream writer. This forces the buffer to be written to disk immediately, in case it's not full and is sporadically filled with small chunks of data, which would otherwise delay flushing for a long time.\n      1.1.1 Path.GetTempPath() method used for default log path if log path from config is not read properly.\n      1.1.0 Removed OS platform checks. Removed OS platform hardcoded default path, the default path is now current working directory of the executable.\n      1.0.1 Syntax cosmetics.\n\t\t\t1.0.0 Initial release.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "1.7.0",
